355	    /** Move a claim to a new status; a move its status does not allow is refused (409), as is
356	     *  a move the user's role may not make by the sheet's permission matrix (403), settling by the user who opened the claim (403), settling a deferred claim (409), settling a PENDING claim (409: it is
357	     *  approved or rejected instead), voiding a SETTLED claim by anyone but a steward (403) or more
358	     *  than 7 days after its settlement (409), and any move of a claim due in a closed period (423). A
359	     *  clerk settling a claim whose due is above the sheet's clerk limit sends it to PENDING. Settling
360	     *  a claim whose due is above the proof threshold in force on its date while it has no proof is
361	     *  refused (422) before the clerk limit is considered. */
362	    @Transactional
363	    public Claim changeStatus(String sheetId, String user, long id, ClaimStatus to) {
364	        return changeStatus(sheetId, user, id, to, null);
